WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.443 --> 00:00:15.844
home was beautiful.

2
00:00:16.985 --> 00:00:20.727
The entrance hall had a stone floor covered by a large rug.

3
00:00:21.867 --> 00:00:24.649
The furniture was made of rich wood and leather.

4
00:00:24.669 --> 00:00:30.012
"We'll have tea in the parlor," Charlotte said to Florence.

5
00:00:30.676 --> 00:00:34.178
She led Vinnie and Mandy to a lovely room with a piano.

6
00:00:35.298 --> 00:00:39.680
Charlotte sat on the velvet-covered piano bench and began to play.

7
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:46.203
"I've been playing since I was four," Charlotte bragged.

8
00:00:47.423 --> 00:00:48.724
"I love music.

9
00:00:50.004 --> 00:00:52.905
Mother says she'll take me to see Johann Strauss.

10
00:00:54.066 --> 00:00:57.127
His orchestra plays at Buckingham Palace sometimes."

11
00:00:57.147 --> 00:01:00.501
"Mandy!" Vinnie whispered.

12
00:01:01.522 --> 00:01:03.743
He had taken the photo out of his pocket.

13
00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.665
"The picture is glowing blue."

14
00:01:06.685 --> 00:01:12.109
"We have to find the sewing machine," whispered Mandy.

15
00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:18.414
Then she suddenly called out to Charlotte, "May we have a tour of your house?"

16
00:01:20.335 --> 00:01:23.498
Charlotte stopped playing, shrugged, and rang a bell.

17
00:01:25.019 --> 00:01:26.280
Florence walked back in.

18
00:01:27.672 --> 00:01:30.533
"Florence can show you around," said Charlotte.

19
00:01:30.553 --> 00:01:34.175
"Certainly," smiled Florence.

20
00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.456
"Right this way.

21
00:01:37.876 --> 00:01:44.019
This house has twelve rooms, including a library, four bedrooms, and the parlor."

22
00:01:44.039 --> 00:01:46.760
"Does Charlotte go to school?"

23
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.020
asked Mandy.

24
00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.521
"She has a private teacher.

25
00:01:51.722 --> 00:01:57.044
Miss Charlotte also takes ballet, piano, and art lessons," said Florence.

26
00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:00.445
"What about the poor children in London?"

27
00:02:01.746 --> 00:02:02.426
asked Vinnie.

28
00:02:02.446 --> 00:02:06.848
"Most of them leave home and go to school until they are ten.

29
00:02:08.068 --> 00:02:12.230
Then they work at the factory where their parents work," said Florence.

30
00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:16.192
"You saw some women and their children at the factory."

31
00:02:16.212 --> 00:02:21.854
"Yes, the women were sewing by hand," said Mandy.

32
00:02:21.874 --> 00:02:23.995
"That's hard work."

33
00:02:25.155 --> 00:02:29.553
Florence nodded and said, "And it takes a lot of time.

34
00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:33.836
But Charlotte's father just brought home something special."

35
00:02:33.856 --> 00:02:36.198
"What is it?"

36
00:02:36.738 --> 00:02:37.459
asked Mandy.

37
00:02:37.479 --> 00:02:42.122
"I will show you," Florence said with a smile.

38
00:02:43.583 --> 00:02:46.865
Upstairs, Florence stood before a closed door.

39
00:02:46.885 --> 00:02:52.989
"Mr. Singer, an inventor, came up with a great idea," she said.

40
00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:56.952
Florence quietly opened the door.

41
00:02:59.428 --> 00:03:02.169
"It's a sewing machine," said Vinnie.

42
00:03:02.189 --> 00:03:05.051
"You already know about this?"

43
00:03:06.351 --> 00:03:07.852
asked Florence, shocked.

44
00:03:10.173 --> 00:03:11.694
"Vinnie thinks it's amazing!"

45
00:03:12.254 --> 00:03:13.274
Mandy said quickly.

46
00:03:13.294 --> 00:03:17.276
"Charlotte's father should put these in his factory."

47
00:03:18.557 --> 00:03:19.917
Florence shook her head.

48
00:03:19.937 --> 00:03:26.160
"No, there are only a few machines, and they're expensive."

49
00:03:27.512 --> 00:03:30.455
"Do you know how to use the sewing machine, Florence?"

50
00:03:31.636 --> 00:03:32.396
asked Mandy.

51
00:03:32.416 --> 00:03:39.142
"Oh yes, I make play dresses for Charlotte and said Florence.

52
00:03:39.162 --> 00:03:44.307
"Curtains?" asked Vinnie, looking at the photo again.

53
00:03:45.468 --> 00:03:47.089
It was starting to turn red.

54
00:03:47.109 --> 00:03:50.912
"Oh no, Master Vinnie," explained Florence.

55
00:03:50.932 --> 00:03:54.936
"Charlotte's father would never have homemade curtains."

56
00:03:56.296 --> 00:03:57.597
"Well, then what?"

57
00:03:58.178 --> 00:03:58.939
asked Mandy.

58
00:03:58.959 --> 00:04:05.665
"Just something for me to wear," replied Florence, giggling.

59
00:04:06.606 --> 00:04:11.230
She shyly took something from a nearby chair and held it up.

60
00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:16.855
"Underpants!" shouted Mandy.

61
00:04:16.895 --> 00:04:21.960
The children's eyes closed as they fell down the dark tunnel.

62
00:04:25.279 --> 00:04:26.473
They were back home.
